_1.ogg","category":"battle","text":"ターゲット確認。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%A7%92%E6%A5%AF%20%E8%8A%B1%E5%87%9B/EKYpdA9b50FJSeQWIVwEwq7r8U2EcwfN.ogg"},{"description":"Karin_ExSkill_2.ogg","category":"battle","text":"目標を捉えた。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%A7%92%E6%A5%AF%20%E8%8A%B1%E5%87%9B/6W6sgFQKY4ID2foUQGghhoQgERkkN543.ogg"},{"description":"Karin_ExSkill_3.ogg","category":"battle","text":"私に任せて。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%A7%92%E6%A5%AF%20%E8%8A%B1%E5%87%9B/bt84IF5kQBuIj2u7QErp7VyAcpxkpHEM.ogg"},{"description":"Karin_ExSkill_Level_1.ogg","category":"battle","text":"先生の敵は逃がさない。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%A7%92%E6%A5%AF%20%E8%8A%B1%E5%87%9B/LkJvUa2hx3af0OpoVgo7jBNFvyd4dMlR.ogg"},{"description":"Karin_ExSkill_Level_2.ogg","category":"battle","text":"任務…開始。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%A7%92%E6%A5%AF%20%E8%8A%B1%E5%87%9B/Ri9kM6aapwDj4CaLnSKfB4wvhuckfHz2.ogg"},{"description":"Karin_ExSkill_Level_3.ogg","category":"battle","text":"一発で吹っ飛ばす。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%A7%92%E6%A5%AF%20%E8%8A%B1%E5%87%9B/IxkmL8MFSnPtCqrVyYw586JyYMg5QDkS.ogg"},{"description":"Karin_ExWeapon_Get.ogg","category":"growup","text":"戦争の勝率は、武器の発展具合に比例するもの。 先生、これからの私の活躍を期待してて。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%A7%92%E6%A5%AF%20%E8%8A%B1%E5%87%9B/OLg5IP4lP03FWUV9Bkc9DqU7zP13XJ8O.ogg"},{"description":"Karin_Formation_In_1.ogg","category":"formation","text":"後方支援を任せて","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%A7%92%E6%A5%AF%20%E8%8A%B1%E5%87%9B/V4nG02Qhf6zNnGqKHFUd4B2Cabs7gwSJ.ogg"},{"description":"Karin_Formation_In_2.ogg","category":"formation","text":"狙撃なら、専門だから","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%A7%92%E6%A5%AF%20%E8%8A%B1%E5%87%9B/9zyIO4OQIdw1BKZhd3JWWHWRjdjcpt3c.ogg"},{"description":"Karin_Gachaget.ogg","category":"growup","text":"元々私の主はミレニアムそのものだけど、今日だけは…先生がご主人様だ。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%A7%92%E6%A5%AF%20%E8%8A%B1%E5%87%9B/BqsxogQknY7Dkxfo0HlBhrIeAr5Ot6g8.ogg"},{"description":"Karin_Growup_1.ogg","category":"growup","text":"ありがとう先生。先生がくれたこの力は、C&Cの助けを必要とする人達のために使う。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%A7%92%E6%A5%AF%20%E8%8A%B1%E5%87%9B/mf3nQWbbCXamQU38WtSVD1EQm1vDJwbc.ogg"},{"description":"Karin_Growup_2.ogg","category":"growup","text":"この力、先生の為に。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%A7%92%E6%A5%AF%20%E8%8A%B1%E5%87%9B/aXH2pakqBUfiRMTC1ybeYN2zPXrU7iLw.ogg"},{"description":"Karin_Growup_3.ogg","category":"growup","text":"どんな依頼でも、私に任せて。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%A7%92%E6%A5%AF%20%E8%8A%B1%E5%87%9B/vTCQKNDCC68dyIZRZtn4yn7ZGyEtAgNK.ogg"},{"description":"Karin_Growup_4.ogg","category":"growup","text":"訓練は苦いけど、その実は甘いものだ。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%A7%92%E6%A5%AF%20%E8%8A%B1%E5%87%9B/avn17KN3SczZ8e3TYJxS5PKyVX23L5WB.ogg"},{"description":"Karin_Lobby_1.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"ターゲット確認。目標を排除する。 …冗談。隠れなくていいよ。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%A7%92%E6%A5%AF%20%E8%8A%B1%E5%87%9B/sDsirYZjo9cgXYNqlVcEFC9h1WioBHSM.ogg"},{"description":"Karin_Lobby_2.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"問題ない。先生。その件はもうとっくに解決した。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%A7%92%E6%A5%AF%20%E8%8A%B1%E5%87%9B/4GyemAOZjTthi2azBVqSp81BaMypA813.ogg"},{"description":"Karin_Lobby_3.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"…どうやって？そ、それは…。…気にしなくても大丈夫だ。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%A7%92%E6%A5%AF%20%E8%8A%B1%E5%87%9B/4joSKi1iknxgPNtj1oPHwYi97XpK31qy.ogg"},{"description":"Karin_Lobby_4.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"今日はどんな任務を遂行する？ なんであれ、私は手伝うよ。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%A7%92%E6%