iki/voices/students/%E8%A7%92%E6%A5%AF%20%E8%8A%B1%E5%87%9B/apudia2aNcAEazECQPVK2YVIdvTNHWLQ.ogg"},{"description":"Karin_MemorialLobby_5.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"ああっ！い、いきなり立たないで！危ないから！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%A7%92%E6%A5%AF%20%E8%8A%B1%E5%87%9B/8JIIu6aAjq8l5vFpj2pgv42azotvqD7T.ogg"},{"description":"Karin_Relationship_Up_1.ogg","category":"growup","text":"珍しい気分。こんな気持ちは…初めてだから。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%A7%92%E6%A5%AF%20%E8%8A%B1%E5%87%9B/QEbmDi01C0dFR5Za8QEXUaMPkE9EhoMT.ogg"},{"description":"Karin_Relationship_Up_2.ogg","category":"growup","text":"伝えたい気持ちができた。それを伝えるのがきっと、私にとってもっとも大事な任務になる。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%A7%92%E6%A5%AF%20%E8%8A%B1%E5%87%9B/iUlEvF86aej6gKp3jUoXIGYgUOmntJIy.ogg"},{"description":"Karin_Relationship_Up_3.ogg","category":"growup","text":"先生がそばにいるというだけで、特別な気持ちになる。…どうしてだろう。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%A7%92%E6%A5%AF%20%E8%8A%B1%E5%87%9B/g0666S1qRTwFoK9BQasKONsaRRinZ2bF.ogg"},{"description":"Karin_Relationship_Up_4.ogg","category":"growup","text":"成長してると思う。生徒として、メイドとして、そして…な、なんでもない。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%A7%92%E6%A5%AF%20%E8%8A%B1%E5%87%9B/aeAmiJmYqjtZnQpedo2XoOSNBK28YLVR.ogg"},{"description":"Karin_Season_Birthday.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"誕生日か…。別に喜ぶようなことではないけど。 先生が祝ってくれると、特別な気分になるね。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%A7%92%E6%A5%AF%20%E8%8A%B1%E5%87%9B/WlrzgaPmaOa1UJBcJc33znoFphWJR6OL.ogg"},{"description":"Karin_Season_Birthday_Player.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"おめでとう先生。 無愛想だから…うまく話せないけど。 先生がここに来てくれて本当に、嬉しい。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%A7%92%E6%A5%AF%20%E8%8A%B1%E5%87%9B/rwi4EVU17XSuMs1tPSethj0ZtQq2dTPS.ogg"},{"description":"Karin_Season_Halloween.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"トリートオアファイアー！飴をくれないと発砲する！ …あれ？こういうのじゃない？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%A7%92%E6%A5%AF%20%E8%8A%B1%E5%87%9B/3sQ5bZTLA3bVEQHoT8dAWZ0TXz7rwY8Y.ogg"},{"description":"Karin_Season_NewYear.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"明けましておめでとう先生。今年もよろしく。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%A7%92%E6%A5%AF%20%E8%8A%B1%E5%87%9B/98t7QD3IEsHS9RwQ9UdXuXv82sztqFYb.ogg"},{"description":"Karin_Season_Xmas.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"クリスマスか…。サンタはいらない。先生がいるから。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%A7%92%E6%A5%AF%20%E8%8A%B1%E5%87%9B/CeGlwJbpsjxOkc3VRsiMnpaUCJB5HVU8.ogg"},{"description":"ch0282_formation_select","category":"formation","text":"","text_original":"うっ……丈が、気になる。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%A7%92%E6%A5%AF%20%E8%8A%B1%E5%87%9B/original/jp/ch0282_formation_select.ogg"}],"voice_cn":[{"description":"karin_battle_in_1","category":"battle","text":"这里是花凛，到达指定地点。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%A7%92%E6%A5%AF%20%E8%8A%B1%E5%87%9B/UiroFnftmq2iIZmRTbjaGopSjI0pnOCP.ogg"},{"description":"karin_battle_in_2","category":"battle","text":"已确认敌人，全员，行动开始！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%A7%92%E6%A5%AF%20%E8%8A%B1%E5%87%9B/L8YCseFwAgrTvgUOMWKZJ25gLVFktHHz.ogg"},{"description":"karin_battle_tsa_1","category":"battle","text":"让你见识一下，C&C直升机的威力。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%A7%92%E6%A5%AF%20%E8%8A%B1%E5%87%9B/XbuDBi4H6edsdBRJdCMX8sbj5NprfYQy.ogg"},{"description":"karin_battle_tsa_2","category":"battle","text":"呼号02，开始空中支援！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%A7%92%E6%A5%AF%20%E8%8A%B1%E5%87%9B/SivUTh2b2hhbAYFtJ9Z3jftU7FBTfyWh.ogg"},{"description":"karin_cafe_act_1","category":"cafe","text":"可爱的东西？当然喜欢了，而且是非常喜欢。怎么，有什么问题吗？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%A7%92%E6%A5%AF%20%E8%8A%B1%E5%87%9B/gWgEwRdcfqZmuBIgtBqN9XShCTEOCOb8.ogg"},{"description":"karin_cafe_act_2","category":"cafe","text":"妮露前辈和明日奈前辈一直都冲在最前线。我？我负责保护她们的身后。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%A7%92%E6%A5%AF%20%E8%8A%B1%E5%87%9B/tQ91mN4RNFKCFeyRTJoYQkaGv3gViEha.ogg"},{"description":"karin_cafe_monolog_1","category":"cafe","text":"还得学数学？唉，看见数字就头疼。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%A7%92%E6%A5%AF%20%E8%8A%B1%E5%87%9B/tcz6uObA1nhpWXcaaGBDzI8DAwX5cQIo.ogg"},{"description":"karin_cafe_monolog_2","category":"cafe","text":"这地方好漂亮啊......什么时候我也能......啊，你，你听见了？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%A7%92%E6%A5%AF%20%E8%8A%B1%E5%87%9B/CCrO8Uu5uzlTKCwv05enPbFGGCwvPry3.ogg"},{"description":"karin_cafe_monolog_3","category":"cafe","text":"偶尔休息一下也是很重要的。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%A7%92%E6%A5%AF%20%E8%8A%B1%E5%87%9B/vpo9UoDF0frgo3wMCLSGJAceuyPZ677B.ogg"},{"description":"karin_commonskill","category":"battle","text":"不会打偏的。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%A7%92%E6%A5%AF%20%E8%8A%B1%E5%87%9B/DgJvr39tLm8fHSDjwUD792YGkqoa66Iy.ogg"},{"description":"karin_exskill_1","category":"battle","text":"确认目标。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%A7%92%E6%A5%AF%20%E8%8A%B1%E5%87%9B/yl3KUbZIHfga2NtwmFfCdCLeUMWRDKLY.ogg"},{"description":"karin_exskill_2","category":"battle","text":"目标已捕获。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%A7%92%E6%A5%AF%20%E8%8A%B1%E5%87%9B/64xtLH09seirUbr9k8xHEHdaTw5y0ULE.ogg"},{"description":"karin_exskill_3","category":"battle","text":"交给我。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%A7%92%E6%A5%AF%20%E8%8A%B1%E5%87%9B/iMcepfKy35WfQoQeudoZ8mboOtNjk2kH.ogg"},{"description":"karin_exskill_level_1","category":"battle","text":"不会放走老师的敌人。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%A7%92%E6%A5%AF%20%E8%8A%B1%E5%87%9B/Zi77V9WdgbGGGstWZbffnFpQD9af2vN9.ogg"},{"description":"karin_exskill_level_2","category":"battle","text":"任务，开始。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%A7%92%E6%A5%AF%20%E8%8A%B1%E5%87%9B/eXpXhbDmwuxTbv9eSOE4RFivT4YoQ82x.ogg"},{"description":"karin_exskill_level_3","category":"battle","text":"一枪就让你灰飞烟灭。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%A7%92%E6%A5%AF%20%E8%8A%B1%E5%87%9B/1lgAbQ8fvrs3aWJ06ftPrRjKExtKXwQX.ogg"},{"description":"karin_exweapon_get","category":"growup","text":"战争的胜率与武器的发达程度成正比。老师，期待我在未来的活跃吧。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%A7%92%E6%A5%AF%20%E8%8A%B1%E5%87%9B/dWmiL26KMbAHunCaNTqx587ePw7YE462.ogg"},{"description":"karin_formation_in_1","category":"formation","text":"后方支援交给我。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%A7%92%E6%A5%AF%20%E8%8A%B1%E5%87%9B/BnzqzAaZytiuN9cUQXumAxwRqAalzrWd.ogg"},{"description":"karin_formation_in_2","category":"formation","text":"狙击是我的专长。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%A7%92%E6%A5%AF%20%E8%8A%B1%E5%87%9B/uFCzjivzlb7FL6fo812d7HzMEOngVUOO.ogg"},{"description":"karin_gachaget","category":"growup","text":"虽然我真正的主人是千禧年，不过今天，老师是我的主人。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%A7%92%E6%A5%AF%20%E8%8A%B1%E5%87%9B/yirKBt9MJTmEA7n6Igqz8ZLEYILCqYbN.ogg"},{"description":"karin_growup_1","category":"growup","text":"谢谢老师。老师给我的这份力量，我会用在需要C&C帮助的那些人身上。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%A7%92%E6%A5%AF%20%E8%8A%B1%E5%87%9B/dweUQNsY8O3xrrcyYam5jRXns8lVGhS3.ogg"},{"description":"karin_growup_2","category":"growup","text":"我会把这力量，献给老师。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%A7%92%E6%A5%AF%20%E8%8A%B1%E5%87%9B/GhOoD3PChBSyBJ6grVNfTae5Z1XvIsqn.ogg"},{"description":"karin_growup_3","category":"growup","text":"有什么委托尽管交给我吧。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%A7%92%E6%A5%AF%20%E8%8A%B1%E5%87%9B/wLfWpFdqiVIb8PuUV2fNcdRriaCPZ6qL.ogg"},{"description":"karin_growup_4","category":"growup","text":"训练虽然辛苦，但果实是甜蜜的。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%A7%92%E6%A5%AF%20%E8%8A%B1%E5%87%9B/DR0jsTudkYIHdtNE5We47wmxwfQSPBPW.ogg"},{"description":"karin_lobby_1","category":"lobby","text":"目标已锁定，准备歼灭。......开玩笑的，不用躲起来啦。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%A7%92%E6%A5%AF%20%E8%8A%B1%E5%87%9B/j3NfW4pd7AQwXaOVveZVtg2fdgRkHiyV.ogg"},{"description":"karin_lobby_2","category":"lobby","text":"没问题，老师。那件事早就解决了。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%A7%92%E6%A5%AF%20%E8%8A%B1%E5%87%9B/OyTnap92IS74RWRJcjDomnQgxJIxtPUl.ogg"},{"description":"karin_lobby_3","category":"lobby","text":"怎么解决的？额...嗯，那个，怎么解决的并不重要。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%A7%92%E6%A5%AF%20%E8%8A%B1%E5%87%9B/fzaObYMTwBuWFNDedGkDhnt0zvxbUAEg.ogg"},{"description":"karin_lobby_4","category":"lobby","text":"今天要执行什么任务？无论是什么样的任务，我都会帮你的。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%A7%92%E6%A5%AF%20%E8%8A%B1%E5%87%9B/oqH2CspghLkWjuyDZk61GN8G9oCKI682.ogg"},{"description":"karin_login_1","category":"lobby","text":"嗯？是老师啊。等你很久了。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%A7%92%E6%A5%AF%20%E8%8A%B1%E5%87%9B/rdqsY1u0k0s9aVzH8PgebbIjPrwvPlK6.ogg"},{"description":"karin_login_2","category":"lobby","text":"老师的日程已经确认了，今天也请多关照。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%A7%92%E6%A5%AF%20%E8%8A%B1%E5%87%9B/zsP0UdeTGGWxh9gKeXurWMGNmcqg4QM0.ogg"},{"description":"karin_memoriallobby_1_1","category":"lobby","text":"这，这样子......真的也能算是奖励吗......？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%A7%92%E6%A5%AF%20%E8%8A%B1%E5%87%9B/Do3zPdLYuUnFxKe2G4XYhsjtrWD4heaR.ogg"},{"description":"karin_memoriallobby_1_2","category":"lobby","text":"额，不是，只是觉得......","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%A7%92%E6%A5%AF%20%E8%8A%B1%E5%87%9B/zbRVbPnuZmYqw08P4k6LkbfRSwpHCPNV.ogg"},{"description":"karin_memoriallobby_2_1","category":"lobby","text":"这也太让人害羞了。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%A7%92%E6%A5%AF%20%E8%8A%B1%E5%87%9B/AKK1EB3KMtVkbQG8iQedSUmUnFdYv252.ogg"},{"description":"karin_memoriallobby_2_2","category":"lobby","text":"不过，要是老师喜欢的话......","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%A7%92%E6%A5%AF%20%E8%8A%B1%E5%87%9B/D5YLeU6KqOw3GSYPbPXQKKClmLQCFEYU.ogg"},{"description":"karin_memoriallobby_3_1","category":"lobby","text":"嗯？再，用力点？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%A7%92%E6%A5%AF%20%E8%8A%B1%E5%87%9B/jG8pdefzy4PQDRkTZjDkIrfVyppo90an.ogg"},{"description":"karin_memoriallobby_3_2","category":"lobby","text":"知，知道了......","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%A7%92%E6%A5%AF%20%E8%8A%B1%E5%87%9B/iAzam0rgIcYUDRcC57BvkW91fdxB3Utg.ogg"},{"description":"karin_memoriallobby_4","category":"lobby","text":"老师喜欢的话，那我也，喜欢......","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%A7%92%E6%A5%AF%20%E8%8A%B1%E5%87%9B/QH33ufJAD8qQY87fjUZeVFB5RTW00ifS.ogg"},{"description":"karin_memoriallobby_5","category":"lobby","text":"啊？别，别突然站起来啊！这样很危险的！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%A7%92%E6%A5%AF%20%E8%8A%B1%E5%87%9B/V58sTtY3fkkUhfKaIkIUSRmi56jSdKTI.ogg"},{"description":"karin_relationship_up_1","category":"growup","text":"这种感觉，很不一般。这还是我第一次有这种心情。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%A7%92%E6%A5%AF%20%E8%8A%B1%E5%87%9B/8L6sGFXDL5xjnf57ylfj12WCQ3eZVVyc.ogg"},{"description":"karin_relationship_up_2","category":"growup","text":"我有一份心意想要传达。把它传达出去，对我来说无疑是最重要的任务。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%A7%92%E6%A5%AF%20%E8%8A%B1%E5%87%9B/07q5MVMakqLNDQ1X8f9hR36VpdkNJ4v9.ogg"},{"description":"karin_relationship_up_3","category":"growup","text":"老师仅仅是在我身边，就让我感觉很特别，为什么呢？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%A7%92%E6%A5%AF%20%E8%8A%B1%E5%87%9B/ga54O58kYLsCvCGe5qdfQcx7hVfno07N.ogg"},{"description":"karin_relationship_up_4","category":"growup","text":"我认为自己正在成长，作为一个女生，作为一个女仆，还有......没，没有了......","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%A7%92%E6%A5%AF%20%E8%8A%B1%E5%87%9B/mLAZTG1g8jSHd475IUqzia207nsJYKZR.ogg"},{"description":"karin_season_birthday","category":"lobby","text":"生日啊？我没觉得这是什么值得高兴的事。不过老师这么一祝贺我，还真有种特别的感觉呢。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%A7%92%E6%A5%AF%20%E8%8A%B1%E5%87%9B/q4bFGCW1hyQPXFoTYvGUCoqhe2dNWFNZ.ogg"},{"description":"karin_season_birthday_player","category":"lobby","text":"生日快乐，老师。我这个人不太懂人际交往，也不太会说话......不过，老师你来了，我是真的很开心。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%A7%92%E6%A5%AF%20%E8%8A%B1%E5%87%9B/WkvU2wP7MXUPIxYt80X1Dt6o5kr5p3xL.ogg"},{"description":"karin_season_halloween","category":"lobby","text":"不给糖就\"导弹\"！如果不给我糖，我就要发射导弹了！啊，不是这个意思？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%A7%92%E6%A5%AF%20%E8%8A%B1%E5%87%9B/2fsasiuIMq2yXSfqEqkCELhOqipLDzJ7.ogg"},{"description":"karin_season_newyear","category":"lobby","text":"新年快乐，老师。今年也请多多关照。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%A7%92%E6%A5%AF%20%E8%8A%B1%E5%87%9B/I3qR9KcrsCE493eDQaafOezLscGV4UIN.ogg"},{"description":"karin_season_xmas","category":"lobby","text":"圣诞节啊......圣诞老人就免了。毕竟，我有老师呢。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%A7%92%E6%A5%AF%20%E8%8A%B1%E5%87%9B/hb1SzI4vkipDoFxU3rFYMc393mh19pDw.ogg"},{"description":"karin_title","category":"lobby","text":"Blue Archive.","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%A7%92%E6%A5%AF%20%E8%8A%B1%E5%87%9B/br4EOjLFWmafnXqDY7AxjvPATOU38zD5.ogg"},{"description":"karin_season_midautumn","category":"lobby","text":"谢谢老师,我会珍藏这块月饼的。  什么?还是尽快吃掉比较好吗?  好吧。 ","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%A7%92%E6%A5%AF%20%E8%8A%B1%E5%87%9B/OOrgv3rBKTqyTX3SNMcdsEByzXjjLQMQ.ogg"},{"description":"karin_season_chinesenewyear","category":"lobby","text":"